Applies to this directory, which is derived from:

  github.com/townsendmerino/goinfer v0.24.1
    embeddinggemma2/model.go   -> internal/adapters/embeder/engine/model.go
    embeddinggemma2/encoder.go -> internal/adapters/embeder/engine/encoder.go

  github.com/townsendmerino/aikit v1.76.0
    embed/safetensors.go       -> internal/adapters/embeder/engine/safetensors.go
    (header parsing and validation rules, dtype widening; the read path is
    rewritten to go through io.ReaderAt instead of a memory mapping)

The vendored model checkpoint used by the tests, testdata/golden/, comes from
the same goinfer module (testdata/embeddinggemma2-tiny).
